    {
        "text": "Black is closing in. Black, black, black, everything is black, except for bright-red blood. You cannot even tell if you are facing something that is living or not."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not fear\u2014not one step back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stand up, if you still have strength\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miner"
    },
    {
        "text": "The black steps through the bodies, some of whom were miners, some of whom were guards, and some of whom were just ordinary Ursines."
    },
    {
        "text": "The constant screams make it very clear that, whether you turn to run or not, the spears appearing out of thin air will catch you."
    },
    {
        "text": "You can only watch as the spears continue to rise from the ground, impaling body after body, threatening to blanket the entire ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Emperor's Blade'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_daggerslow",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, the spears remove themselves from the mountain of corpses, forming a longsword in the hand of the black shadow."
    },
    {
        "text": "The entity raises its sword and points it toward you, speaking in an indistinguishable voice."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
