    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You feel the heat coming from behind you, like a burning fire that spreads all over you. It makes your blood run hot, and your eyes wide and clear. They shout your name and push you forward."
    },
    {
        "text": "In the embrace of solidarity, you leap and take aim at what seems to be the thorax of the black entity\u2014"
    },
